      "content_markdown": "Example 29. Resolve into factors: $x^3 + 6x^2y + 11xy^2 + 6y^3$\n\nSolution: $x^3 + 6x^2y + 11xy^2 + 6y^3$\n\n$= \\{x^3 + 3 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot 2y + 3 \\cdot x \\cdot (2y)^2 + (2y)^3\\} - xy^2 - 2y^3$\n\n$= (x + 2y)^3 - y^2(x + 2y) = (x + 2y)\\{(x + 2y)^2 - y^2\\}$\n\n$= (x + 2y)(x + 2y + y)(x + 2y - y)$\n\n$= (x + 2y)(x + 3y)(x + y) = (x + y)(x + 2y)(x + 3y)$",
